WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.120
Why do you have a bat?

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.200
Please just look at me.

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.640
Yeah, I was the goalie.

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:04.760
I love you.

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:05.760
What are you doing here?

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:06.720
Kiss him.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:13.880
You're in goal.

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:18.200
-I've never played.
-I know.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.560
Scoring some shots will give
the boys a confidence boost.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:21.880
It's a first-day-back thing.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:24.200
Get them energised,
fired up.

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:25.200
What about me?

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.120
Try not to take any
in the face.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.240
You want to be
co-captains now?

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.840
We've, uh, gotten past
our differences.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:35.000
That doesn't sound
very competitive.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:38.280
-Who taught you that crap?
-You did.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:41.920
Because you're
a great coach.

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:50.640
They're right.

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:53.200
I am a great coach.

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:04.440
Nice driving, Kate.

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:11.520
You let this happen,
you stupid old man.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:14.320
All you saw was him.

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:23.400
This looks expensive.

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:28.480
Yeah, 900 bucks.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.880
And how expensive is this?

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:35.840
He destroyed our family.

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:46.240
Take him.

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:48.840
Your family…

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:52.080
is right in front of you.

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:17.960
We got it, sir.
Found the jeep.

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:19.560
Drop their weapons.

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:21.160
Yes, sir.

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:48.040
Nathan, I always forget.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:50.000
How many bones
in the human body?

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:53.200
I don't know. Let's count.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:56.880
That's one.

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:00.640
It's OK.

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:05.400
Lydia never believed

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:07.560
I was one of the good guys
anyways.

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:12.600
She'll believe me.

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:29.840
Jackson.

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:31.120
Is it over?

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:41.080
I'm not getting
anything either.

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:03.680
Does it hurt anymore?

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:05.880
No.

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:08.840
Good.

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:19.600
Mum!

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.200
Is this a party or a date?

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:25.320
Maybe both.

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:27.040
And her name is?

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:28.560
Allison.

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:29.880
Allison.

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:30.840
Nice.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.160
Thank you.

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:36.240
We don't need
to have a talk, do we?

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:38.120
You alright?

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:42.000
Uh, I-- I think so.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:45.960
Who knocked you out?

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:47.680
One of my friends
or one of yours?

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:51.560
I'm not sure I have
any friends right now.

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:53.680
Not sure I blame them.

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:59.800
You're OK to stand?
We're gonna need your help.

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:02.520
With what?

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:04.200
Taking back the hospital.

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:09.080
Mason, there's gotta
be something going on.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:11.160
No, you remember
we're freshmen, right?

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:12.800
We just got off
a school bus.

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:15.520
We're not gonna be hitting
the clubs till 4:00 a.m..

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:17.960
OK, movie at your place,
9:00, OK?

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:29.720
You OK?

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:30.720
Yeah.

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:34.880
Except I think that this
bedpan was still being used.

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:44.520
Please don't kill me.

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:47.080
Do you know
who wrote that list?

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:49.680
Laura. Laura Hale.

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:52.880
Do you know
why she was looking for you?

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:54.360
I know why.

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:55.520
Turn around, Adrian.

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:58.280
Turn around
and I'll show you.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:02.720
-Turn around!
-No, please.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.520
Look at me.
Look at what you've done.

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:09.200
Get down!

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:15.520
Two…

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:17.720
bodies?

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:20.760
No blood, no wounds.

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:21.920
What do they look like?

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.280
Statues.

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:26.880
Greek.

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:29.080
Peter, close your eyes.
Do it. Close them now--

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:40.520
What the hell?

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:48.640
What if silver is like
a poison to them?

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:51.840
What if it needs
to stay in the body?

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.680
What if that's what she
was trying to tell Scott…

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.120
what she was
trying to tell you?

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:01.480
That she'd figured it out.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.480
These four
were still setting

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.160
when she went off
to meet Scott.

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:07.240
We can stop them.

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:10.040
Dude, watch the paint job.

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:12.160
Is it over?

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.160
Now it's over.

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:29.320
Good to see you, coach.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:32.720
Stay right there!

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:34.320
Hang on, hang on!

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:36.520
This little delinquent
belongs to me.

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:41.840
Drop your weapons!

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:45.960
Parrish, drop their weapons.

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:47.640
Yes, sir.

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:49.480
I thought you said
you wanted to make friends.

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:50.640
Not like that.

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:52.840
You said you wanted
to be noticed.

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:54.560
I could set myself on fire
and be noticed.

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:56.160
-Well, then you'd be dead.
-Exactly.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:02.360
Kira.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:03.880
Kira.

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:06.000
You don't have to do this.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.160
I made a deal with them.

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:11.600
I need to.

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:14.160
It's not for my parents.

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:15.320
It's not for you.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:17.360
It's for me.

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:18.880
How long is it gonna take?

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:22.240
As long as it takes.

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:32.720
Keep it for me.

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:34.720
Keep it safe.

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.440
What are you doing here?

00:08:40.760 --> 00:08:41.920
Huh?

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:43.800
This is private property.

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:45.600
Scott, what happened
to your eyes?

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:47.320
I had to. I'm sorry.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:48.480
Scott, you have to heal.

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:50.000
If your eyes stay
like this much longer,

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:51.400
the damage
is gonna be permanent.

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:56.920
Mum, three calls
on my first day

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:58.160
is a little overdoing it.

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:01.840
Everything except a pen.

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:03.880
Oh my God, I didn't
actually forget a pen.

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:07.480
OK, OK, I gotta go.
Love you.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:11.240
I love-- I love you…

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:13.520
Scott…

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:16.520
Scott McCall.

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:19.800
Don't. Please, don't.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.600
Allison, don't, please.

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:25.320
You have to tell my dad.

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:27.520
You have to tell my dad.

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:28.880
Tell him…

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:30.240
Tell-- You have to--

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:37.120
No.

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:49.760
Hey, Liam, wanna explain
what that was out there?

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:51.440
What do you mean?

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:53.520
That little display,
your little circus act.

00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:54.640
What circus act?

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:55.920
You caught every shot.

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:58.760
I was in goal.

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:01.320
Yeah, but nothing, not
a single shot got past you.

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:02.960
Yeah, I was the goalie.

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:06.520
-Who taught you that crap?
-You did.

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:10.200
Because you're
a great coach.

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:18.280
Malia, you said something
about guilt the other day.

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:21.960
You said it came
with a visceral reaction.

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:25.000
I said it made me feel
sick to my stomach.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.440
Guilt often
becomes physical.

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:32.160
I'm trying.
It's just not working.

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:34.720
-I can't focus.
-Hey, hey. Look at me.

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:36.840
Yes, you can.
Just concentrate.

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:38.800
I can't.
I can't-- I can't do it.

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:41.280
Yes, you can. Scott,
please, just look at me.

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:49.640
Malia…

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:53.320
Kiss him.

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:55.320
What?

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:58.280
That jacket
is absolutely killer.

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:00.480
Where'd you get it?

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:01.960
Kiss him.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:04.000
You weren't
answering your phone.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.080
Why do you have a bat?

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:07.600
I thought
you were a predator.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:08.600
A pre--

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:11.160
Come on, Scott, concentrate.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.480
I'm trying.
It's just not working.

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:21.240
Stiles, what the hell
are you doing?

00:11:25.520 --> 00:11:26.520
My friends…

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:29.640
my pack.

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:33.920
And you can be with us
if you want…

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:37.640
but you're gonna
have to fight.

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:39.440
Against Monroe?

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:42.680
And everyone
that follows her.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:44.960
She said she'd find me,

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:47.560
that she'd hunt me down
and kill me.

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:49.120
She didn't care
how old I was.

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:52.560
She said I was a monster.

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:55.000
You're not a monster.

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:00.040
You're a werewolf…

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:03.200
like me.

